graph TB
    Orchestrator["Platform Orchestrator<br/>(rhods-operator / opendatahub-operator)"]
    User["User / ODH Dashboard"]
    KubeAPI["Kubernetes API Server<br/>6443/TCP"]

    subgraph Operator["workbenches-operator Deployment (UID 65532, RO rootfs, drop ALL)"]
        Manager["manager binary<br/>/manager"]
        Reconciler["WorkbenchesReconciler<br/>Kustomize render + SSA"]
        NotebookWH["NotebookWebhook<br/>/workbenches-connection-notebook"]
        HWPWH["HardwareProfile Injector<br/>/workbenches-hardware-profile"]
        TLSEnsurer["Webhook TLS Ensurer<br/>30s re-ensure loop"]
        TLSBoot["TLS Bootstrap +<br/>SecurityProfileWatcher"]
        PlatformCfg["Platform Config Handshake"]
        Manifests["Bundled Manifests<br/>/opt/manifests/workbenches/*"]

        Manager --> Reconciler
        Manager --> NotebookWH
        Manager --> HWPWH
        Manager --> TLSEnsurer
        Manager --> TLSBoot
        Reconciler --> PlatformCfg
        Reconciler -->|reads + renders via krusty| Manifests
    end

    WorkbenchesCR["Workbenches CR<br/>default-workbenches<br/>components.platform.opendatahub.io/v1alpha1"]
    NotebookCR["Notebook CR<br/>kubeflow.org/v1"]
    ConfigMap["ConfigMap<br/>odh-workbenches-config"]
    APIServerCR["APIServer CR<br/>config.openshift.io<br/>TLS profile"]
    HWProfile["HardwareProfile<br/>infrastructure.opendatahub.io"]
    RCT["ResourceClaimTemplate<br/>resource.k8s.io"]
    Secrets["User connection Secrets"]

    subgraph Operands["Deployed Operands"]
        KFNC["Kubeflow notebook-controller<br/>(openshift overlay)"]
        ODHNC["ODH notebook-controller<br/>(odh / rhoai overlay)"]
        ImageStreams["Notebook ImageStreams<br/>(odh / rhoai)"]
        WSC["workspaces-controller v2<br/>(optional)"]
        WSK["WorkspaceKinds<br/>(optional)"]
    end

    ServiceCA["OpenShift service-CA"]
    CertManager["cert-manager"]

    Orchestrator -->|creates / projects fields| WorkbenchesCR
    WorkbenchesCR -->|watched by| Reconciler
    ConfigMap -->|watched by| PlatformCfg
    APIServerCR -->|watched by| TLSBoot
    Reconciler -->|SSA, field manager workbenches-operator| KFNC
    Reconciler -->|SSA| ODHNC
    Reconciler -->|SSA| ImageStreams
    Reconciler -.->|SSA when workbenchesV2 Managed| WSC
    Reconciler -.->|SSA when workbenchesV2 Managed| WSK
    Reconciler -->|status: ModuleStatus phase, releases| WorkbenchesCR

    User -->|create / update| NotebookCR
    NotebookCR -->|admission via kube-apiserver| NotebookWH
    NotebookCR -->|admission via kube-apiserver| HWPWH
    NotebookWH -->|SAR check + get| Secrets
    HWPWH -->|get| HWProfile
    HWPWH -->|get| RCT
    KFNC -->|reconciles| NotebookCR

    TLSEnsurer -->|annotates Service + MWC| ServiceCA
    TLSEnsurer -.->|fallback: ClusterIssuer + Certificate| CertManager

    Reconciler --> KubeAPI
    NotebookWH --> KubeAPI
    HWPWH --> KubeAPI

    style Manager fill:#4a90e2,color:#fff
    style Reconciler fill:#4a90e2,color:#fff
    style NotebookWH fill:#4a90e2,color:#fff
    style HWPWH fill:#4a90e2,color:#fff
    style TLSEnsurer fill:#4a90e2,color:#fff
    style TLSBoot fill:#4a90e2,color:#fff
    style PlatformCfg fill:#4a90e2,color:#fff
    style Manifests fill:#bcd4f0
    style WorkbenchesCR fill:#f5a623
    style NotebookCR fill:#f5a623
    style HWProfile fill:#f5a623
    style RCT fill:#f5a623
    style APIServerCR fill:#f5a623
    style KFNC fill:#7ed321
    style ODHNC fill:#7ed321
    style ImageStreams fill:#7ed321
    style WSC fill:#7ed321
    style WSK fill:#7ed321
    style Orchestrator fill:#7ed321
    style ServiceCA fill:#e8e8e8
    style CertManager fill:#e8e8e8
    style KubeAPI fill:#e8e8e8
